## Choosing the Right Workflow
Click through the sub-pages in the navigation sidebar to explore each workflow model in depth:
* **[Centralized Workflow](./centralized-workflow.md):** Best for very small teams or solo developers transitioning to Git.
* **[Feature Branch Workflow](./feature-branch-workflow.md):** The industry standard for agile teams using Pull Requests.
* **[Forking Workflow](./forking-workflow.md):** Used for open-source development or projects with external contributors.

